  "content": "\n\n<h1>GpuTape 🩹</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8457cf2b01e18302ef61da3256328bfb4b94ad14.png\" alt=\"fo\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6c152554bb3141433b6dca087131f96f00a876ba.png\" alt=\"fa\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/554809ee9ae740db0707b7cd1420d937b490cd6b.png\" alt=\"qu\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d6378864df2d8f2699289ec7f439e26b5c8db60.png\" alt=\"neo\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ca0de18375553419eff9ce315dccceb885971010.png\" alt=\"i\"></p>\n<p>修复显存泄漏，基于 Anthus(Velum) 制作的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvideotape%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\">VideoTape</a>。</p>\n<p>“VideoTape”与“修复 GPU 显存泄漏”非常相似。\n我的模组基于“VideoTape”，与“修复 GPU 显存泄漏”无关。\n同时使用这些模组并不会提升效果！</p>\n<h3>与原版（VideoTape）对比：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>GPUTape 仅支持客户端</li>\n<li>GPUTape 不使用已弃用的 Java 方法（适用于 1.19+）</li>\n<li>GPUTape 支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Quilt（VideoTape 仅支持 Fabric）</li>\n<li>GPUTape 支持较老版本（1.18 及更早）</li>\n<li>GPUTape 兼容 Vulkan</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可用语言🌐（适用于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>English(en_us) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>Russian(ru_ru) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>German(de_de) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>Ukrainian(uk_ua) - StarmanMine142</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>我的其他模组：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fh_plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">H+</a>（新内容 &amp; 难度优化）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252febe-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnlightenedBlockEntities/EBEReforged</a>（增强方块实体模组分支版）[已停止维护]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmpalladium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a>（性能优化）</li>\n</ul>",
